## Code

All original Python source code in this repository (the frozen confirmatory
instrument, the confirmatory orchestrator, and all post-confirmatory analysis
scripts) is licensed under the MIT License. See `LICENSE-CODE`.

## Documentation, data, and derived scientific artifacts

All original documentation, generated data (blinded instances, classification
and scoring outputs, seed derivation records), analysis reports, and other
non-software scientific artifacts authored by the repository owner are
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
See `LICENSE-DATA`.

## Third-party material

No third-party code, data, or documents with incompatible licensing terms
have knowingly been included in this repository. Bibliographic references to
external work are citations only (title, author, venue), not redistribution
of the cited material itself; see `03_post_confirmatory/08_prior_art/`. If
any third-party material with unclear licensing terms were identified during
archival assembly, it would be withheld from publication and reported to the
repository owner rather than published under either license above; no such
material was found.
